    case 119            bitmask 36 -> 0, all five probes
    difftest amd64      105 pass, 0 fail
    difftest aarch64    107 pass, 0 fail
    stage 2 corpus      420 of 426                    unchanged
    mc-tcc              builds, 1,651,969 bytes
    twelve.sh           12 of 12

A KNOWN NEIGHBOUR, NOT CLOSED AND NOT CAUSED BY THIS. `(*p)++` -- parentheses
around the dereference -- segfaults, and does so identically on the compiler
before this patch. The comment at cc_core.c's paren_lvalue site names that
spelling as one it handles; it does not. Recorded rather than folded in, so
that this patch measures one thing.

